<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Commands</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>commands</a>
</pre>
<p>Gives a complete listing of the commands you can use. Most have a help page of 
their own: type help and the command, like <a cmd='#'>help look</a>.
</p><p>Some commands are only there in certain places, or near certain people or 
things: the postman takes mail, a storage clerk store and unstore, a shopkeeper 
buy and sell, a teacher practice and info. They work where they make sense, and 
the help for each tells you where.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Socials</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Communications</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Newbie</a>
</pre>




</div>